{
  "company_name": "ForecastPro Machinery",
  "industry": "Machinery",
  "use_case": "Demand forecasting and order backlog management",
  "space_title": "ForecastPro Machinery - Demand Forecasting 📈",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Machinery\n\n**Use case:** Demand Forecasting & Order Backlog Management\n\nForecastPro Machinery — sales-and-operations planning analytics covering bookings, forecasts, and order backlog across equipment models and customer regions. S&OP planners and Demand Managers tune forecasts week-to-week; the VP Sales and CFO use it to size capacity commitments, manage backlog and cancellations, and lock in revenue against forecast accuracy targets.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Forecast accuracy (%) — best-in-class 75–85% at SKU level (100% − MAPE)\n- MAPE (%) — mean absolute percentage error; <15% world-class, 15–25% average\n- Fill rate (%) — order fulfillment target ≥95%\n- Backlog units — capacity and lead-time stress indicator\n- Forecast bias — chronic over/under-forecast detector\n- Cancellation rate (%) — demand-quality signal\n- Total revenue ($) — financial impact of demand performance\n- Lead time (days) — competitive promise tracking\n\n**Data sources**\n- `customer_orders` — order-level bookings with quantity, price, region, status, lead time, discount\n- `demand_forecasts` — forecast vs actual snapshots with bias, MAPE, confidence interval, model version\n- `demand_kpi_monthly` — monthly accuracy, fill rate, backlog, revenue, new vs cancelled orders",
  "schema_basename": "mach_demand_forecast",
