  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports demand forecasting and backlog management at ForecastPro. Stakeholders: S&OP planners and Demand Managers (model accuracy by SKU, bias detection), VP Sales (fill rate, backlog age, cancellations), and CFO (revenue at risk, capacity utilization vs forecast).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Forecast accuracy = AVG(forecast_accuracy_pct) = 100 − MAPE; best-in-class 75–85% at SKU.\n- MAPE = AVG(mape_pct); world-class <15%, average 15–25%.\n- Fill rate = AVG(fill_rate_pct); target ≥95%.\n- Backlog = SUM(backlog_units); aging beyond promised lead time signals capacity gap.\n- Forecast bias = AVG(forecast_bias); persistent positive = over-forecast (carrying cost).\n- Cancellation rate = SUM(cancelled_orders) / SUM(new_orders); leaders <3%.\n- Revenue = SUM(total_revenue_usd); growth and mix indicator.\n- Lead time = AVG(lead_time_days); customer commitment vs actual delivery.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - customer_orders_metrics (source: customer_orders) — dims: order_date, product_family, customer_region, order_status; measures: total_order_revenue, total_order_quantity, total_orders, avg_lead_time, max_order_quantity.\n  - demand_kpi_metrics (source: demand_kpi_monthly) — dims: kpi_month, product_family; measures: avg_forecast_accuracy, avg_fill_rate, total_backlog, total_revenue, total_new_orders, total_cancelled_orders.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. equipment_model, forecast_bias, mape_pct, model_version, discount_pct).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "What is the monthly trend in forecast accuracy by product family over the trailing 12 months?",
    "Top 10 equipment models by backlog units — which are at greatest risk of missed lead time?",
    "Which customer regions have the highest order cancellation rate this quarter?",
    "Rank product families by fill rate — which are below the 95% target?",
    "Show monthly trend in total revenue vs new orders received.",
    "Top 10 equipment models by total order revenue this year, and what was the forecast accuracy for each?",
    "Which forecast model versions have the worst MAPE, and what is the cost of the bias?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has total order revenue trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT order_date, MEASURE(total_order_revenue) AS total_order_revenue",
        "FROM {fqn}.customer_orders_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY order_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total units ordered changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT order_date, MEASURE(total_order_quantity) AS total_order_quantity",
        "FROM {fqn}.customer_orders_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY order_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total monthly revenue?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', kpi_month) AS month, MEASURE(total_revenue) AS total_revenue",
        "FROM {fqn}.demand_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has highest forecast accuracy percent changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(max_forecast_accuracy_percent) AS max_forecast_accuracy_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.demand_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does total units ordered break down by equipment model ordered for 'Backlog' records?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT equipment_model, COUNT(*) AS record_count, SUM(order_quantity) AS total_order_quantity",
        "FROM {fqn}.customer_orders",
        "WHERE order_status = 'Backlog' GROUP BY equipment_model ORDER BY total_order_quantity DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total forecasted demand units over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT forecast_date, SUM(forecasted_units) AS total_forecasted_units",
        "FROM {fqn}.demand_forecasts",
        "GROUP BY forecast_date ORDER BY forecast_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average forecast accuracy percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(forecast_accuracy_pct) AS avg_forecast_accuracy_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.demand_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
